CPU (aarch64): BF16 weights x F32 activations through an iqk GEMM ported from ik_llama.cpp
(iqk_gemm_floats.cpp, commit 009dce19). ggml_vec_dot_bf16 has no NEON path, so a BF16 mul_mat on ARM ran a
scalar loop. Same switches as the other iqk kernels: GGML_CPU_IQK=0 or GGML_CPU_IQK_TYPES without bf16.

