+// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
+//
+// Adapted from ik_llama.cpp (https://github.com/ikawrakow/ik_llama.cpp) commit 009dce19,
+// ggml/src/iqk/iqk_gemm_floats.cpp (the __aarch64__ part: QBF16 / QF32 and mul_mat_Qx_Qy_T).
+// Only the BF16 weights x F32 activations kernels are kept.
+//
